WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.944
Two ways to spend time together in South
Florida.

00:00:04.954 --> 00:00:08.241
Mommy and Daddy Break Club is a morning for
parents,

00:00:08.252 --> 00:00:11.646
with coffee, a DJ, time to recharge

00:00:11.656 --> 00:00:14.199
and easy introductions over brunch.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:17.582
We’re planning two mornings a month in
rotating venues

00:00:17.593 --> 00:00:21.263
with optional wellness experiences on
select dates.

00:00:21.273 --> 00:00:24.816
Retro Glam is a night built around
throwback music,

00:00:24.827 --> 00:00:27.837
dancing and styled photo moments.

00:00:28.518 --> 00:00:32.167
Both are experiences we create and produce
locally.

00:00:32.178 --> 00:00:35.359
Explore each format and join the priority
list

00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:37.912
for details when an edition opens.
